      "source_text": null,
      "summary": "The AI MQP is 3/3 units and applies AI knowledge and techniques within the selected concentration. A sole adviser must be AI core/collaborative faculty within that discipline; otherwise an AI core/collaborative faculty member and a faculty member with disciplinary knowledge co-advise. This is the host MQP applied to the concentration, not a second additional MQP.",
