      "source_text": null,
      "summary": "If a course overlaps the natural/engineering-science requirement and concentration or disciplinary electives, add other BS-AI distribution courses to retain ten program units. The host degree’s 4/3-unit floor at 4000 level or above can be met across core, concentration and other distribution work; it is not an extra four-course local concentration minimum.",
